.TH ZHEN\-CODEINDEX 1 "2026-11-07" "unheaded 83232cd4" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
zhen\-codeindex \- Build Zhen's source shard, or a text corpus index, and search the corpus: word search, no network.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zhen\-codeindex
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Build Zhen's source shard, or a text corpus index, and search the corpus: word search, no network.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-corpus \fISTRING\fR
index the plain files under this directory instead of a repository; \-\-out must name the corpus index
.TP
.B \-\-out \fISTRING\fR
index directory (default /var/zhen/code\-index)
.TP
.B \-\-repo \fISTRING\fR
git repository (default .)
.TP
.B \-\-search \fISTRING\fR
search the corpus index in \-\-out and print JSON; builds nothing
.TP
.B \-\-top\-k \fIN\fR
most results \-\-search prints (default 8)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
zhen\-codeindex \-\-repo . \-\-out /var/zhen/code\-index
zhen\-codeindex \-\-corpus /opt/tomb/grimoire \-\-out /opt/tomb/grimoire/index
zhen\-codeindex \-\-out /opt/tomb/grimoire/index \-\-search T1566 \-\-top\-k 5
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
